    "text": "As shown in the figure, a chain of mass <math><mi>m</mi></math> is placed on a smooth quarter circular portion of radius <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">R</mi></math>. End <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A&nbsp;</mi></math>is tied with a wedge while the remaining chain is free, then the minimum work required to be done by the external agent to make the chain horizontal keeping point <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi></math>&nbsp;fixed, is<br />\r&nbsp; <img alt=\"\" src=\"assets\\qt0012_aaf80169437f.png\" style=\"width: 192px; height: 178px;\" />"
